.TH SECRETIVE 1 "2026-11-07" "Secretive" "General Commands Manual"
.SH NAME
secretive \- Manage SSH keys in the Secure Enclave
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B secretive
.I command
[
.I subcommand
] [
.I flags
]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B secretive
provides a command-line interface to interact with keys stored in the Mac
Secure Enclave via Secretive.app.
.SH COMMANDS
.SS key
Manage Secure Enclave keys. Subcommands: list, show, create, delete, rename.
.SS cert
Manage OpenSSH certificates. Subcommands: list, import, delete.
.SS agent
Manage SecretAgent. Subcommands: status.
.SS env
Output shell environment configuration for SSH_AUTH_SOCK.
.SS version
Output version information.
.SH EXAMPLES
secretive key list --json
.br
secretive key create deploy --type mldsa-65 --auth presence
.br
eval $(secretive env)
.SH SEE ALSO
Secretive.app
